          "Build relationships with Asian business and professional networks in the district; as this community grows across Georgia suburbs, recognition of Asian entrepreneurs' specific legislative needs — licensing, credit access, trade policy — becomes a durability factor in a district where Asian voters represent near-parity with some other demographic groups."
