          "Build an active constituent services operation that demonstrates tangible results: in an unopposed cycle, the incumbent has the opportunity to establish a record of constituent responsiveness that inoculates against primary challenge; housing dispute resolution, job training access, and navigating public benefits are the practical services this constituency needs.",
