          "Lead with housing affordability and renter protection: 61% renter rate at $63,482 income means housing costs are a direct household budget issue; tenant protection, affordable housing development, and anti-displacement policy are not left-wing positions but basic constituent service for a renting-majority district.",
          "Establish visible presence in Asian community institutions and media: at 16.52% Asian, this is the fourth-largest demographic group and one that can swing close elections if turnout and perception shift; specific engagement on education quality, small-business support, and workplace equity builds durable support in this constituency.",
          "Document legislative record on education and workforce development: the 33.6% college-attainment rate and young median age signal a constituency evaluating on economic mobility; visible accomplishment on K-12 funding, community college affordability, and job training creates incumbent protection before the district becomes partisan battleground."
