          "Address working-class economic security across the district: at $67,025 income with 21% renters, housing affordability, property tax management, and the cost of living are the primary material concerns for both renters and homeowners. Legislative action on these issues resonates across racial lines and builds a coalition that consolidates the current Republican advantage.",
