          "Lead with upper-middle-class economic concerns: at $70,677 median income and 33.2% college attainment, HD-124 contains a financially stable but education-conscious constituency for whom school funding, higher education access, and healthcare affordability are direct quality-of-life issues that shape voting behavior independent of partisan identity.",
