          "Develop specific education and workforce pipeline messaging: at 19.9% college attainment and 35.2 median age, younger adults are evaluating whether Atlanta offers pathways to economic mobility — community college funding, apprenticeship programs, and job training directly tied to available employment are the education issues that resonate.",
          "Protect the 29.76% white and 3.49% Hispanic minorities from invisibility: while the district's demographic and electoral center is Black, these communities' economic concerns around jobs, housing, and services are real — specific constituent attention prevents a challenger from exploiting perceived neglect."
