        "Identify and maintain relationships with white crossover voters: the crossover coalition in HD-145 is likely built around specific economic concerns — agricultural, healthcare, property tax — and those voters require ongoing constituent service attention rather than assumption that their Democratic vote will repeat absent active engagement."
