          "Lead on renter protections and housing affordability: make affordable housing development, eviction prevention, and tenant-friendly lease terms central to legislative priorities; in a district where over one-quarter of households are renters, this is a material quality-of-life issue that unopposed incumbents often neglect.",
          "Demonstrate constituent service visibility: ensure district office responsiveness to casework, publicize successful constituent advocacy outcomes, and create mechanisms for working-class and minority communities to report problems directly; unopposed incumbents often underinvest in constituent service, creating an opening for a challenger who emphasizes responsiveness.",
