          "Build authentic constituent relationships with the Black community (28.65%) and Hispanic community (9.3%) through specific attention to education funding, criminal justice, healthcare equity, and workforce development — the unopposed 2024 result does not indicate durability; it indicates an absence of opposition, not constituent satisfaction.",
          "Demonstrate tangible value to renters (33.6% of the district) through state policy engagement on tenant protections, housing affordability, utility costs, and neighborhood investment — renter households are the constituency most likely to evaluate a representative on whether their take-home pay is growing and their housing is stable.",
