        "Lead on military community economic security as the constituency's core political identity: Fort Stewart area housing assistance, veteran healthcare access, military spouse employment support, and district infrastructure investment consolidate the Republican base through specific constituency service rather than partisan messaging alone.",
        "Recognize that a 22.81% Black population and 9.78% Hispanic community together represent nearly one-third of the district — engaging these constituencies with specific constituent attention on healthcare access, economic opportunity, and community investment fulfills the governance obligation and builds long-term electoral durability."
