          "Lead with working-class household economic security: at $65,259 median income with 39% renters and a 43-year median age, this district's constituency is managing housing costs, healthcare access, and childcare alongside wages that have not kept pace with inflation—these are the material issues that determine voting behavior in a working-class diverse district, not abstract partisan positioning.",
