          "Engage the 27.5% Black population as a core constituency, not a special interest: the Black community in GA-SD-13 shares the same economic pressures as white working-class households—renting, wage work, healthcare access—and deserves specific constituent attention on these issues rather than being treated as a demographic afterthought or secondary concern.",
