          "Lead with constituent service and substantive policy detail: at 39-year median age and 52.4% college attainment, this constituency evaluates candidates on policy specifics, not partisan messaging — education funding, property tax fairness, school quality, and local growth management are the concrete governance issues that drive evaluation among affluent, educated homeowners.",
