          "Build authentic relationships with the 20% Black constituency: while African American voters are reliably Democratic, they are not a monolith; targeted engagement on criminal justice, economic opportunity, and community investment demonstrates that you are serving the whole district, not taking any constituency for granted.",
          "Recognize that 100% unopposed is a status quo result, not a durable foundation: prepare for a credible Republican challenger by building a constituent record so strong on bread-and-butter delivery—schools, infrastructure, public safety—that a partisan attack cannot gain traction regardless of national political headwinds."
