          { name: "Assuming Black Community Electoral Loyalty Without Delivery on Economic Outcomes", tag: "avoid", why: "The 68.69% Black constituency in GA-SD-44 is loyal to Democratic representation generally, but that loyalty is contingent on visible governance outcomes on issues that matter to Black working families — housing, education, healthcare, economic mobility. Any senator who takes this coalition for granted and fails to deliver concrete legislative results or secure tangible resources for district constituents risks facing primary challenge from candidates who credibly promise more aggressive governance; electoral dominance does not substitute for authentic constituent service." }
